"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.2-stable\n4.7-beta1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta1 - macOS Tahoe (26.4.1) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M3 Max (Apple9) - Apple M3 Max (14 threads) - 36.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nOpening the dependency window from the missing dependencies popup, and closing it without actually fixing the dependency, breaks the scene's \"Open Anyway\" button.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the MRP. Attempt to open `main.tscn`. In the missing dependencies window, fold open the `res://deleted.tscn` item and click on the pencil icon. Then close the additional dependencies popup, and click 'Open' – which now respawns the missing dependency window. Subsequent clicks on Open Anyway don't work either.\n\n<img width=\"571\" height=\"804\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a259643d-2746-4858-bbb3-ed1eec5bfd93\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[missing_dependency_bug_2026-05-06_15-24-37.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27441547/missing_dependency_bug_2026-05-06_15-24-37.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/user